 \section{Discussion and limitations}
 The model assumes units are nonnegative, commensurate, correctly classified, and observed without error. It omits time, discounting, uncertainty, leakage, legal enforceability, governance capture, investment returns, administrative cost, additionality, and ecological measurement. A real reserve can be mislabeled, diverted, impaired, or economically inadequate even when the arithmetic passes. The note therefore supplies no validated runtime kernel and no project recommendation.
